      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The West Kern Oil Museum, at 1168 Wood Street, displays historic oil equipment and photos tracing Taft’s petroleum heritage back to Native American times.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
